<title>PERU: Peru says one hostage, two officers died.</title>
<headline>Peru says one hostage, two officers died.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peruvian President Alberto Fujimori said on Tuesday that one hostage, two soldiers and 14 rebels died when government troops stormed the Japanese ambassador's residence in Lima.</p>
<p>&quot;There was no other way out,&quot; Fujimori said, standing on a car roof outside the residence. He said one of the dead soldiers was a security guard for his son, Kenji.</p>
